# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: GoogleDrive (Custom)
# Description: Google Drive services service endpoints
# Scope: Dedicated Drive, Docs, and third-party upload endpoints
# Architectural Boundary:
#   - www.googleapis.com is shared across Google services (used by Primuse for audio streams)
#     and is strictly excluded from GoogleDrive to prevent breaking generic Google APIs.
# ==============================================================================

# Target: Google Drive web & core storage
# Evidence: Google Drive web console telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Direct routing to large-bandwidth / Hong Kong nodes
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive.google.com

# Target: Google Docs / Sheets / Slides real-time collaboration
# Evidence: Google Workspace document editor network traces, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Colocates Docs collaboration with Drive storage policy
DOMAIN,docs.google.com

# Target: Google Drive third-party application connectors
# Evidence: Google Drive third-party integration API traces, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Third-party app Drive synchronization
DOMAIN,drive-thirdparty.google.com

# Target: Google Drive large file pickup and direct download
# Evidence: Google Drive file download stream analysis, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Routes large file downloads to dedicated storage egress
DOMAIN,filepickup.google.com
